t": "", "type": "text"}]}, "type": "feedback"}, {"type": "post_instructions", "contents": [{"content": "Instructions: Listen to the audio. Type in the missing words.", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "learning_skills", "contents": [{"content": "Reading", "type": "skill"}, {"content": "Writing", "type": "skill"}, {"content": "Listening", "type": "skill"}]}], "id": 10, "stimuli_ids": []}, {"template_override": 1, "type": "RSLT", "questions": [{"responses": [{"correct": 0, "_data": [{"content": "", "type": "text"}], "selected": 0, "id": 0}, {"correct": 1, "_data": [{"content": "", "type": "text"}], "selected": 0, "id": 1}], "_data": [{"type": "question", "contents": [{"content": "", "type": "text"}]}], "id": 0}], "_data": [{"type": "instructions", "contents": []}, {"type": "group", "contents": [{"content": "Quiz", "type": "group_name"}]}, {"content": {"allowed_attempts": 2, "incorrect_feedback": [{"content": "Whoops! Something important is missing.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Maybe next time...", "type": "text"}], "correct_feedback": "Correct!", "attempt_feedback": [{"content": "", "type": "text"}, {"content": "", "type": "text"}]}, "type": "feedback"}], "id": 11, "stimuli_ids": []}], "type": "scholar", "stimuli": [{"template_override": 1, "type": "welcome", "_data": [], "contents": [{}], "id": 0}, {"template_override": 1, "type": "audio", "id": 1, "title": "", "contents": [{"type": "slideshow", "value": {"audiosrc": "engenn9le13ob10re2aud01", "coverimg": "engenn9le13ob10re2img06.jpg", "images": [{"image": "engenn9le13ob10re2img06.jpg", "text": "", "time": "0", "id": 0}, {"image": "engenn9le13ob10re2img06.jpg", "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Adam</span>: Hi Joe!<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Joe</span>:  Hi Adam, how's it going?<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Adam</span>: Not bad, I'm still job hunting. Next week, I will be going to an interview for a freelance journalist position. I will have been to four different interviews in two weeks, but no luck so far. How about you?<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Joe</span>:  Same. I have another interview next week. I hope it goes better than the last one. What an ordeal. It was a nightmare interview!<br>", "time": "100", "id": 1}, {"image": "engenn9le13ob10re2img07.jpg", "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Adam</span>: Why? What happened?<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Joe</span>: The interview was for a job in marketing in the airline industry. The interview was scheduled for 14:00, which in international time is 2:00 p.m. I was running late so I was very rushed. I ended up wearing two different shoes. I didn't comb my hair or iron my shirt.  <br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Adam</span>: Oh, man.<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Joe</span>:  It only gets worse.  I arrived just on time, or what I thought was just on time.  It turns out the recruiter made a mistake. He said he thought the interview was scheduled for 4:00 p.m. He said the president wasn't free until then, so I had to wait 2 hours.  <br>", "time": "22300", "id": 2}, {"image": "engenn9le13ob10re2img07.jpg", "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Adam</span>: Oh, that's too bad.<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Joe</span>: That's not all. Then, during the interview, the COO asked me a lot of unusual questions I wasn't prepared for. He asked me what my greatest weakness was. I'll have to think of a good answer for that one for the future. Then he asked me why the references I gave them had incorrect phone numbers. That didn't look very good.  He also asked me what I thought about the company mission statement, which I didn't know. I'm going to make sure I do a lot more research before my next interview. I'll read everything I can find on the company website.  I'll think about answers to those tough questions!  And I'm updating the phone numbers of my references tonight!<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Adam</span>: I'm going to do the same thing. <br>", "time": "56300", "id": 3}]}}], "_data": []}, {"template_override": 1, "type": "audio", "id": 2, "title": "", "contents": [{"type": "p", "value": "<span class=\"strong\">Tom</span>:  How did your interview go yesterday?<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sandra</span>:  It was quite an ordeal. It was a nightmare, actually.<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Tom</span>:  Why?<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sandra</span>: The job description was for a job in the airline industry, but really they just wanted someone in sales.  I hate sales. How was your interview?<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Tom</span>:  I didn't have it yet. It is scheduled for tomorrow.<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sandra</span>:  Good luck!"}], "_data": []}], "_data": [{"type": "lab_options", "contents": [{"content": true, "type": "has_nav"}, {"content": true, "type": "has_exercise_controls"}]}], "id": 0}], "type": "sena"}